ng, I'm Council Member Linda Lee, chair of the Committee on Finance. I would like to recognize my fellow committee members. We have Council Members Marte, Hudson, Wong, Murano, Deputy Speaker Williams, Council Members Aldebol, J. Sanchez, Council Members Gennaro, Abreu, Avilés, Restler, Brooks-Powers, Narcisse, Restler (sic), and Maloney, and Council Member Mealy. At today's hearing, the Committee will consider and vote on a transparency resolution that would approve the new designations and changes in the designations of certain organizations to receive\n\nfunding in the Expense Budget for Fiscal Years 2024, 2025, and 2026. Do any of my colleagues have comments or statements? Okay, great. And I just want to ask the Clerk to call the roll."],[0,0,"Thank you. Good morning. William Martin, Committee Clerk; roll call vote, Committee on Finance, Preconsidered Resolution, Chair Lee?"],[7,1,"Aye."],[0,0,"Gennaro?"],[8,1,"Aye."],[0,0,"Brooks-Powers?"],[9,1,"Aye."],[0,0,"Feliz?"],[10,1,"(NO RESPONSE)"],[0,0,"Abreu?"],[11,1,"Aye."],[0,0,"Thank you. Council Member Avilés? COUNCIL MEMBER AVILÉS: Aye."],[0,0,"Hudson."],[12,1,"Aye."],[0,0,"Marte?\n\nCouncil Member Marte?"],[13,1,"Aye."],[0,0,"Mealy?"],[14,1,"Aye."],[0,0,"Narcisse."],[15,1,"Aye."],[0,0,"Restler."],[16,1,"I'm just going to pass\n\nfor\n\na\n\nsecond."],[0,0,"Mm-hmm. Williams?"],[17,1,"I vote aye."],[0,0,"Aldebol."],[18,1,"(INAUDIBLE) (PAUSE)"],[0,0,"Aldebol?"],[18,1,"Aye, and my brother-in-law\n\nworks\n\nfor\n\nthe\n\nDepartment\n\nfor\n\nthe\n\nAging."],[0,0,"Thank you. Maloney?"],[19,1,"Aye."],[0,0,"Sanchez?"],[20,1,"Aye."],[0,0,"Wong?"],[21,1,"No, no."],[0,0,"Morano?"],[22,1,"No."],[0,0,"Restler?"],[16,1,"Aye."],[0,0,"With a vote of 14 in the affirmative, 2 in the negative, and 0 abstentions, the item has been adopted by the Committee."],[7,1,"Great. I think we're just going to hold the vote open for one more member, but the rest of you are free to go. Thank you."],[7,1,"I think Council Member Feliz is here. Can we resume?"],[6,0,"Quiet, please. Quiet, please. Quiet, please."],[0,0,"Continuation roll call; Committee on Finance, Council Member Feliz?"],[10,1,"Aye on all."],[0,0,"Final vote is now 15 in the affirmative, 2 in the negative, and no abstentions. Madam Chair, that is a full committee."],[7,1,"Great, we are adjourned. Thank you, everyone. [GAVEL]\n\nWorld Wide Dictation certifies that the foregoing transcript is a true and accurate record of the proceedings. We further certify that there is no relation to any of the parties to this action by blood or marriage, and that there is no interest in the outcome of this matter. Date ____<August 13, 2026_______________"],[23,4,"Reverend Doctor C. Vernon Mason, Minister in Residence Friendship Baptist Church 144 West 131 Street New York, N.Y. 10027"],[5,3,"This is a microphone check for the Stated Meeting of April 16, 2026, recorded by James Marino in the Chambers."],[6,0,"Quiet on the floor, please, quiet on the floor, please. Council Members, please take your seats. (PAUSE) All quiet on the floor, please. All quiet on the floor, please. Can I have your attention, please? Can I please have your attention? Council Members, quiet down, please. Ladies and gentlemen, at this time place, please place all electronic devices, all electronic devices to vibrate. Mr. Majority Leader, it's all yours."],[11,1,"[GAVEL] Good afternoon and welcome to the Stated Meeting of April 16, 2026. I am Majority Leader Shaun Abreu, and I would like to thank you for joining us. As a reminder, decorum must be respected at all times. If you'd like to follow along, the agenda for today's meeting is posted on our website."],[24,4,"Please join us for the Pledge of Allegiance."],[6,0,"All rise!"],[25,4,"[PLEDGE OF ALLEGIANCE]"],[11,1,"Roll call."],[26,0,"Council Member Aldebol?"],[18,1,"Here."],[26,0,"Council Member Ariola?"],[27,1,"Here."],[26,0,"Council Member Avilés? COUNCIL MEMBER AVILÉS: (NO RESPONSE)"],[26,0,"Council Member Banks?"],[28,4,"Here."]